ODW8155 [*] Used builtin function `itertools.groupby`. Prefer `odoo.tools.groupby` instead.
 --> bad_builtin_groupby_no_import.py:5:1
  |
3 | import itertools
4 |
5 | itertools.groupby(records, key=lambda r: r.partner_id)
  | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
help: Replace with `odoo.tools.groupby`
  |
3 | import itertools
4 + from odoo.tools import groupby
5 |
  - itertools.groupby(records, key=lambda r: r.partner_id)
6 + groupby(records, key=lambda r: r.partner_id)
